{
  "source": "course-assets/when-you-need-more/when-you-need-more.mp4",
  "duration": 168.9813125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.16,
      "text": "For many tasks, you open your AI app, ask a question, and keep the conversation going."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.72,
      "end": 10.8,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI. You might need help working through a complicated plan,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.3,
      "end": 14.5,
      "text": "weighing options, or investigating information across sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.32,
      "end": 19.24,
      "text": "Depending on the app and your subscription, you may have three other choices for these"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.24,
      "end": 25.08,
      "text": "demanding tasks. The model, thinking, and research. You won't need to change them every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.28,
      "end": 28.62,
      "text": "But knowing what they do helps you get a significantly better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.62,
      "end": 32.78,
      "text": "When you use an AI app, an LLM powers its answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.48,
      "end": 35.62,
      "text": "Think of it as the engine inside the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.34,
      "end": 38.68,
      "text": "Choosing a model means choosing your engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.52,
      "end": 41.18,
      "text": "Different models have different capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.92,
      "end": 42.92,
      "text": "You start with the default,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.12,
      "end": 45.5,
      "text": "but can upgrade to a more capable one when needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.26,
      "end": 47.72,
      "text": "On the which model graphic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.1,
      "end": 49.9,
      "text": "the everyday model is for quick questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.9,
      "end": 52.08,
      "text": "like suggest a funny movie to watch tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.9,
      "end": 55.5,
      "text": "The more capable model handles demanding tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.76,
      "end": 58.3,
      "text": "For example, help me plan a summer business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.3,
      "end": 61.4,
      "text": "including costs, pricing, and how many customers all need."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.26,
      "end": 66.02,
      "text": "Choosing a model changes your LLM, but thinking is a different variable."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.64,
      "end": 71.14,
      "text": "It doesn't change the engine, it changes how much time the AI spends working through your task."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.78,
      "end": 73.94,
      "text": "AI isn't thinking the way you do,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.14,
      "end": 77.8,
      "text": "but it spends more time working through the task before giving you an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.66,
      "end": 81.12,
      "text": "This next board asks how much thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.86,
      "end": 85.9,
      "text": "With less thinking, AI spends less time working through your task."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.9,
      "end": 89.1,
      "text": "it is useful for less complicated and routine work."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.64,
      "end": 92.74,
      "text": "For example, ask, turn these notes from our group meeting"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.74,
      "end": 93.84,
      "text": "into a clear checklist."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.9,
      "end": 97.44,
      "text": "With more thinking, AI spends more time"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.44,
      "end": 99.52,
      "text": "working through steps, weighing options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.66,
      "end": 100.64,
      "text": "and checking its answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.24,
      "end": 103.64,
      "text": "It is useful for tasks that require analysis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.64,
      "end": 106.58,
      "text": "like coding, planning, and problems with steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.2,
      "end": 110.16,
      "text": "For example, ask, help us divide this project"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.16,
      "end": 111.16,
      "text": "among four people."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.42,
      "end": 113.18,
      "text": "We have one week, different schedules,"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.18,
      "end": 115.48,
      "text": "and only two people know how to edit video."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.42,
      "end": 118.84,
      "text": "There is one more option, research."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.7,
      "end": 121.88,
      "text": "This mode gathers information from different websites"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.88,
      "end": 124.66,
      "text": "and brings it together so you can compare your options."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.46,
      "end": 127.4,
      "text": "Regular chat can look things up on the internet too,"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.52,
      "end": 128.9,
      "text": "but research is designed"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.9,
      "end": 131.22,
      "text": "for a fuller comprehensive investigation"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.22,
      "end": 133.2,
      "text": "across several sources simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.2,
      "end": 136.4,
      "text": "For a regular chat, I live in Dallas."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.74,
      "end": 137.88,
      "text": "How long would it take me to drive"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.88,
      "end": 140.9,
      "text": "to Texas A&M in College Station versus UT Austin?"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.9,
      "end": 147.8,
      "text": "Use deep research to get information from many websites, compare what they say, and build a report that shows sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.44,
      "end": 153.82,
      "text": "For example, ask, I want to study physics and am considering Texas A&M and UT Austin."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.34,
      "end": 160.76,
      "text": "Compare their physics programs, undergraduate research opportunities, admissions requirements, and costs. Show your sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.84,
      "end": 165.86,
      "text": "Model. Thinking. Research. Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
